parameters.text:
=Synthesize this local market intelligence into actionable insights.

City: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.city }}
Sector: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.sector }}
Target Customer: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.target_customer }}
Business Stage: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.business_stage }}

Startup Ecosystem:
{{ $('Fetch Local Startup Ecosystem').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Target Customer Signals:
{{ $('Fetch Target Customer Signals').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Local Events:
{{ $('Fetch Local Events and Opportunities').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "market_pulse": "growing/stable/contracting",
  "ecosystem_highlights": [],
  "customer_pain_points_this_month": [],
  "inbound_messaging_suggestions": [],
  "events_to_attend": [{"event": "", "date": "", "why_relevant": ""}],
  "partnership_opportunities": [],
  "competitive_threats": [],
  "local_market_opportunity": "",
  "summary": "3-4 sentence local market summary"
}

=🏙️ *{{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.city }} Market Brief — {{ $now.toFormat('MMM dd') }}*

*Pulse:* {{ $json.market_pulse.toUpperCase() }}

{{ $json.summary }}

*Customer Pain Points This Month:*
{{ $json.customer_pain_points_this_month.slice(0,3).map(p=>`• ${p}`).join('\n') }}

*Events to Attend:*
{{ $json.events_to_attend.slice(0,2).map(e=>`• ${e.event} (${e.date}): ${e.why_relevant}`).join('\n') }}

*Local Opportunity:* {{ $json.local_market_opportunity }}
